{"case_id": "en-001", "arm": "selector-unlimited", "query": "What is the main topic of the mobility analysis survey?", "query_type": "single_fact", "language": "en", "should_refuse": false, "answer": "根据文档内容，该综述的主要主题是**利用大型语言模型（LLMs）进行交通系统中的移动性分析，特别是聚焦于时间序列预测任务**。文档摘要明确指出，它“探索了使用LLMs解决交通系统中移动性时间序列预测问题的现有方法”，并提供了关于预测应用的文献综述，阐述了研究人员如何利用LLMs、展示了最新的先进进展，并识别了在该领域充分利用LLMs所需克服的挑战 [S1][S6][S7]。", "context": "", "alpha": 1.0, "citation_id_validity": 1.0, "citation_precision": 0.0, "citation_recall": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "correctly_refused": true, "context_supported_citation_validity": 1.0, "fabricated_citation_count": 0, "retrieved_not_in_context_count": 0, "citation_status_counts": {"supported_chunk": 3}, "answer_point_coverage": 0.0, "prompt_tokens": null, "completion_tokens": null, "total_tokens": null, "total_ms": 3437.461900000926, "retrieval_ms": 47.59070000000065, "generation_ms": 3389.8712000009255, "ttft_ms": null, "error": null}
