{"case_id": "multi-004", "arm": "selector-unlimited", "query": "What is speculative decoding?", "query_type": "multi_turn", "language": "en", "should_refuse": false, "answer": "根据文档内容，投机解码（Speculative Decoding）是一种加速大型语言模型（LLM）推理的技术。它通过一个轻量级的草稿模型（draft model）提出一批候选token，然后由完整的目标模型（target model）在单次前向传播中并行验证整个块，通过拒绝采样接受与目标分布一致的最长前缀，并附加一个奖励token。由于验证是并行的，且接受规则精确保持目标分布，投机解码在不损失质量的情况下加速生成。[S1][S2][S5]", "context": "", "alpha": 1.0, "citation_id_validity": 1.0, "citation_precision": 0.0, "citation_recall": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "correctly_refused": true, "context_supported_citation_validity": 1.0, "fabricated_citation_count": 0, "retrieved_not_in_context_count": 0, "citation_status_counts": {"supported_chunk": 3}, "answer_point_coverage": 1.0, "prompt_tokens": null, "completion_tokens": null, "total_tokens": null, "total_ms": 2752.4182999986806, "retrieval_ms": 87.29300000413787, "generation_ms": 2665.1252999945427, "ttft_ms": null, "error": null}
{"case_id": "multi-005", "arm": "selector-unlimited", "query": "How does DSpark improve it?", "query_type": "multi_turn", "language": "en", "should_refuse": false, "answer": "Based on the document, DSpark improves speculative decoding through two complementary components [S5]:\n\n1. **Semi-autoregressive generation** [S5]: It uses a parallel backbone for the bulk of draft computation (keeping draft time nearly independent of block size) and adds a lightweight sequential block to inject dependency among draft tokens, improving acceptance rate (τ) at minimal additional latency [S5].\n\n2. **Confidence-scheduled verification** [S5]: A confidence head estimates per-position acceptance probabilities, and a hardware-aware scheduler uses these estimates to prune low-confidence suffix tokens, cutting unnecessary verification compute [S5].\n\nAdditionally, the document states that DSpark \"unifies high-throughput parallel generation with adaptive, load-aware verification\" [S1], and in real-world deployment within DeepSeek-V4, it accelerates per-user generation speeds by 60%–85% at matched throughput levels compared to the production baseline (MTP-1) [S3].", "context": "", "alpha": 1.0, "citation_id_validity": 1.0, "citation_precision": 0.3333333333333333, "citation_recall": 0.5, "faithfulness": 1.0, "correctly_refused": true, "context_supported_citation_validity": 1.0, "fabricated_citation_count": 0, "retrieved_not_in_context_count": 0, "citation_status_counts": {"supported_chunk": 3}, "answer_point_coverage": 1.0, "prompt_tokens": null, "completion_tokens": null, "total_tokens": null, "total_ms": 3874.445300003572, "retrieval_ms": 85.80550000624498, "generation_ms": 3788.639799997327, "ttft_ms": null, "error": null}
