{"case_id": "multi-004", "arm": "selector-cap3", "query": "What is speculative decoding?", "query_type": "multi_turn", "language": "en", "should_refuse": false, "answer": "根据提供的文档，**投机解码（Speculative Decoding）** 是一种加速大型语言模型（LLM）推理的技术。其核心思想是：\n\n- 使用一个轻量级的草稿模型（draft model）提出一批候选 token（通常为 γ 个）。\n- 然后由完整的目标模型（target model）在单次前向传播中并行验证这些候选 token，接受与目标分布一致的最长前缀，并额外生成一个 bonus token。\n- 由于验证过程是并行的，且接受规则严格保持目标分布不变，投机解码可以在不损失生成质量的前提下加速推理 [S1][S2][S5]。\n\n具体来说，在每次解码循环中，草稿模型提出候选 token，目标模型计算自身分布并与草稿分布比较，按概率 `min(1, p_t(x_k)/p_d(x_k))` 接受每个 token，从左到右验证，第一个被拒绝的位置会丢弃其后的所有 token [S5]。平均每个 token 的延迟为 `(T_draft + T_verify) / τ`，其中 τ 是每轮接受的 token 数 [S5]。", "context": "", "alpha": 1.0, "citation_id_validity": 1.0, "citation_precision": 0.0, "citation_recall": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "correctly_refused": true, "context_supported_citation_validity": 1.0, "fabricated_citation_count": 0, "retrieved_not_in_context_count": 0, "citation_status_counts": {"supported_chunk": 3}, "answer_point_coverage": 1.0, "prompt_tokens": null, "completion_tokens": null, "total_tokens": null, "total_ms": 3568.665200000396, "retrieval_ms": 90.13470000354573, "generation_ms": 3478.5304999968503, "ttft_ms": null, "error": null}
{"case_id": "multi-005", "arm": "selector-cap3", "query": "How does DSpark improve it?", "query_type": "multi_turn", "language": "en", "should_refuse": false, "answer": "Based on the document, DSpark improves speculative decoding through two complementary components [S5]:\n\n1. **Semi-autoregressive generation**: A parallel backbone handles the bulk of draft computation, keeping draft time nearly independent of the block size, while a lightweight sequential block injects dependency among draft tokens to improve acceptance rate at minimal additional latency [S5].\n\n2. **Confidence-scheduled verification**: A confidence head estimates per-position acceptance probabilities, and a hardware-aware scheduler uses these estimates to prune low-confidence suffix tokens, cutting unnecessary verification compute [S5].\n\nThis addresses the limitations of both autoregressive drafters (which have high acceptance but draft time proportional to block size) and parallel drafters (which have fast drafting but poor acceptance due to lack of inter-token dependencies) [S5]. In deployment, DSpark accelerated per-user generation speeds by 60%–85% at matched throughput levels compared to the production baseline (MTP-1) [S3].", "context": "", "alpha": 1.0, "citation_id_validity": 1.0, "citation_precision": 0.0, "citation_recall": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "correctly_refused": true, "context_supported_citation_validity": 1.0, "fabricated_citation_count": 0, "retrieved_not_in_context_count": 0, "citation_status_counts": {"supported_chunk": 2}, "answer_point_coverage": 1.0, "prompt_tokens": null, "completion_tokens": null, "total_tokens": null, "total_ms": 4339.554799997131, "retrieval_ms": 85.18840000033379, "generation_ms": 4254.366399996798, "ttft_ms": null, "error": null}
